          "snippet": {
            "text": "theorem u_le {δ D u0 T0 q : ℝ} (hq : 0 < q) (hδ : |δ| ≤ D / q) (hu0 : 0 ≤ u0)\n    (h : u0 * (3.1416 * (D / q)) ≤ T0 - 200) : δ ≠ 0 → u0 ≤ (T0 - 200) / (π * |δ|) := by\n  intro hδ0\n  have hpi := Real.pi_lt_d4\n  have hd : 0 < |δ| := abs_pos.2 hδ0\n  rw [le_div_iff₀ (by positivity)]\n  have h1 : π * |δ| ≤ 3.1416 * (D / q) := mul_le_mul hpi.le hδ (abs_nonneg _) (by norm_num)\n  exact (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left h1 hu0).trans h",
            "line": 236,
            "truncated": false
          },
          "proof_context": {
            "declaration": "TernaryGoldbach.MajorArcs.u_le",
